    "scrollable_faq_vishal_94zbh9": {
      "type": "scrollable-faq-vishal",
      "blocks": {
        "block_QnJcjU": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "content": "These are the most common options available in our online checkout:\n<br>\n<br>\n<h2>\nHow to use Shop Pay Installments\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Credit / Debit Card</li>\n<li>Shop Pay (pay in full or, if eligible, pay in installments)</li>\n<li>PayPal</li>\n<li>Affirm – Pay Over Time</li>\n<li>Purchase Order (for qualifying buyers)</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n<!-- Orange warning box -->\n\n \nYou may also see express checkout buttons (depending on device/browser), such as Shop Pay, PayPal, Amazon Pay, Apple Pay, Google Pay.",
            "title": "What you'll see at checkout",
            "image_below_link_url_1": "",
            "image_below_link_url_2": "",
            "image_below_link_url_3": "",
            "image_below_link_url_4": "",
            "image_below_link_url_5": "",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "addrtitle1": "",
            "addrtext1": "",
            "addr1": "",
            "addrtitle2": "",
            "addrtext2": "",
            "addr2": ""
          }
        },
        "block_ixUH9m": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<h2>\nShop Pay Installments (inside Shop Pay)</h2>\n<p>To use Shop Pay Installments, select <b>Shop Pay (Pay in full or in installments)</b> at checkout. If eligible, you'll be prompted to choose installments within the Shop Pay flow.</p>\n\n<!-- Orange warning box -->\n<div class=\"faq-warning warning-orange\">\n  <div class=\"faq-warning__header\">\n    <span class=\"faq-warning__icon\"></span>\n    If you don't see installments\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"faq-warning__body\">\n    Installments can be unavailable based on eligibility, purchase amount, or card/bank rules. If you don't see the option, try another card, choose <b>Affirm – Pay Over Time</b> instead, or use another payment method.\n  </p>\n</div>\n<!-- Gray important box -->\n<div class=\"faq-warning warning-gray\">\n  <div class=\"faq-warning__header\">\n    <span class=\"faq-warning__icon\"></span>\n    Important\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"faq-warning__body\">\n    Shop Pay Installments is separate from Affirm. Approval in one does not guarantee the other.\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n<h2>\nAffirm – Pay Over Time (standalone)</h2>\n<p>Select Affirm – Pay Over Time at checkout and follow the prompts to sign in/apply and choose your terms. Affirm approvals and terms are handled by Affirm.\n</p>\n\n<h2>\nPayPal Pay Later (if offered)</h2>\n\n<p>PayPal is a payment method. If PayPal offers you Pay Later options for your order, you'll see them after you log in to PayPal. PayPal provides the terms and makes the approval decision within the PayPal experience.\n</p>",
            "title": "Pay over time options",
            "image_below_link_url_1": "",
            "image_below_link_url_2": "",
            "image_below_link_url_3": "",
            "image_below_link_url_4": "",
            "image_below_link_url_5": "",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "addrtitle1": "",
            "addrtext1": "",
            "addr1": "",
            "addrtitle2": "",
            "addrtext2": "",
            "addr2": ""
          }
        },
        "block_hxMiLG": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We accept major credit and debit cards in checkout. If a card is declined, it is usually due to bank rules (billing address mismatch, fraud prevention, spending limits). If that happens, try another card or choose a different method like Shop Pay or Affirm.\n</p>",
            "title": "Credit & debit cards",
            "image_below_link_url_1": "",
            "image_below_link_url_2": "",
            "image_below_link_url_3": "",
            "image_below_link_url_4": "",
            "image_below_link_url_5": "",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "addrtitle1": "",
            "addrtext1": "",
            "addr1": "",
            "addrtitle2": "",
            "addrtext2": "",
            "addr2": ""
          }
        },
        "block_nE9dyW": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<h2>PayPal</h2>\n\n<p>Choose PayPal at checkout, log in, and confirm your payment. If PayPal offers Pay Later options for your order, you can select them after logging in.\n\n</p>\n\n<h2>\nAmazon Pay</h2>\n\n<p>If Amazon Pay is available, select it at checkout, sign in to your Amazon account, and confirm the payment authorization.\n</p>\n\n<h2>\nApple Pay</h2>\n\n<p>Apple Pay may appear on supported Apple devices/browsers. Select Apple Pay and follow the on-screen prompts to confirm.\n</p>\n\n<h2>\nGoogle Pay</h2>\n\n<p>Google Pay may appear on supported devices/browsers. Select Google Pay and follow the on-screen prompts to confirm.\n</p>\n\n<h2>\nCheckout clarity note</h2>\n\n<p>These digital wallet options are available through our Shopify checkout. You'll place your order on FitnessSuperstore.com, and (depending on the wallet) you may briefly be prompted to sign in/authorize payment before returning to complete checkout.\n</p>",
            "title": "PayPal, Amazon Pay, Apple Pay, Google Pay",
            "image_below_link_url_1": "",
            "image_below_link_url_2": "",
            "image_below_link_url_3": "",
            "image_below_link_url_4": "",
            "image_below_link_url_5": "",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "addrtitle1": "",
            "addrtext1": "",
            "addr1": "",
            "addrtitle2": "",
            "addrtext2": "",
            "addr2": ""
          }
        },
        "block_LbWEti": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>For business purchasing workflows, we can support purchase orders and bank payments. Some of these methods are handled through our team (invoice/quote) rather than a one-click online checkout button.\n</p>\n\n<h2>Wire transfer / ACH</h2>\n\n<p>If you need to pay by wire/ACH, contact us for invoice-based payment instructions.</p>\n\n<h2>\nChecks</h2>\n\n<p>Check payments can be accommodated in certain cases. Contact us for instructions and to confirm timing/processing.\n</p>\n\n<h2>\nPurchase orders</h2>\n\n<p>If your organization requires a purchase order, contact us and we'll guide you through the process and provide the paperwork you need.\n</p>",
            "title": "Purchase orders, wire/ACH, and checks",
            "image_below_link_url_1": "",
            "image_below_link_url_2": "",
            "image_below_link_url_3": "",
            "image_below_link_url_4": "",
            "image_below_link_url_5": "",
            "image_below_origin_proportions": false,
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "addrtitle1": "",
            "addrtext1": "",
            "addr1": "",
            "addrtitle2": "",
            "addrtext2": "",
            "addr2": ""
          }
        },
        "block_CUppjd": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We provide tax information for all customers based on shipping destination and applicable regulations. If you have tax-exempt documentation or need help with tax-related questions, contact our team before placing your order so we can assist.</p>",
            "title": "Tax information",
            "image_below_link_url_1": "",
            "image_below_link_url_2": "",
            "image_below_link_url_3": "",
            "image_below_link_url_4": "",
