      "name": "t:sections.collection-intro.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "paddingsection": "20px 0px 20px 0px",
        "paddingsection_mob": "24px 0px 14px 0px",
        "title": "Gym Packages",
        "description": "For those creating an exercise room, we have created some of the popular options for various gym options based on the number of square feet you have below.\n\nThese are sets of equipment are fully customizable and any pieces can be changed around.\n\n The below is only a starting point to determine what would fit in this size and what equipment/accessories a typical gym of this size would buy. One-exercise strength machines are inefficient, thus smaller gyms and exercise rooms need multipurpose ones.\n\nThese can give you an idea of what gyms of various size would buy and help you furnish a gym with everything you need. We can handle a 250-square-foot home gym, a 5000-square-foot commercial gym, or anything in between.",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/collection-intro-banner.png"
      }
    },
    "text_w8mb3d": {
      "type": "text",
      "disabled": true,
      "custom_css": [
        "@media (max-width: 768px) {h2 {font-size: 2.8rem; line-height: 3.4rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; color: #23232b; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }}"
      ],
      "name": "Text",
      "settings": {
        "text": "<h2>Customizable Gym Packages for Every Space</h2>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "text_LwxrDP": {
      "type": "text",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Text",
      "settings": {
        "text": "<p>Our equipment packages are fully customizable, allowing you to swap pieces to fit your specific needs. These curated sets offer a great starting point, showcasing the type of equipment commonly purchased for gyms ranging from a 250 sq. ft. home gym to a 5,000 sq. ft. commercial facility—or anything in between.</p><p>If you’re outfitting a smaller space, we recommend multifunctional strength machines to maximize efficiency, while larger gyms may benefit from more specialized equipment.</p><p>We’ve proudly delivered gym packages nationwide, helping fitness centers, businesses, and home gyms come to life with quality equipment and expert service. Ready to get started? <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1952ZiMEj_Gr9OXhhOFMVbdYzSshAt6hv?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Check out some of the gyms we’ve helped build</strong></a>.</p><p>Need something tailored to your space? Reach out to us! Our gym design experts work exclusively via email and can create a custom floor plan or recommend packages that fit your gym size and clientele.</p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
